/*  ============================================================================
    CRIB FOR THE XCODE WALK -- read this, not the commit log. 2026-08-19.

    FOUR COMMANDS. Swap the single driver line at the FOOT of this file:

        runTokenHand(tokenHandSubject);     MEASURED: COMPILES
        runTokenWalked(Token);              MEASURED: COMPILES
        runNamE(NamE);                      MEASURED: HANGS  (137)
        runNamEnoParse(NamE);               MEASURED: COMPLETES, exit 0

    ⚠⚠ THE PROVENANCE EXHIBIT WAS BUILT AND IT FAILED ITS OWN EXPECTATION, AND
    THAT FAILURE IS THE FINDING. It was built to show hand-defined COMPILES and
    walk-installed REFUSES. Both compile. **Provenance is not the discriminator**
